                            <article class="pub-card">
                          <div class="pub-card__num">44</div>
                        <div class="pub-card__body">
              <h3 class="pub-card__title">
                                  <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41594-026-01869-6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Universal Pipeline for High-Resolution GPCR Structure Determination.</a>
                              </h3>
              
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Kojima A*</strong>, <strong>Kawakami K*</strong>, Kobayashi N*, <strong>Kobayashi K*</strong>, <strong>Matsui TE</strong>, <strong>Uemoto K</strong>, <strong>Gu Y</strong>, <strong>Narita TJ</strong>, <strong>Fukuda M</strong>, <strong>Kato HE</strong>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Nature Structural &amp; Molecular Biology</strong>, in press (2026).</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>bioRxiv</strong>, doi: <a href="https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.64898/2026.04.02.716066v1">https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.64898/2026.04.02.716066v1</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">PDB: <a href="https://doi.org/10.2210/pdb9UVT/pdb">9UVT</a>, <a href="https://doi.org/10.2210/pdb9UVU/pdb">9UVU</a>, <a href="https://doi.org/10.2210/pdb9UVV/pdb">9UVV</a>, <a href="https://doi.org/10.2210/pdb9UVW/pdb">9UVW</a>, <a href="https://doi.org/10.2210/pdb9UVX/pdb">9UVX</a>, <a href="https://doi.org/10.2210/pdb9UVY/pdb">9UVY</a>, <a href="https://doi.org/10.2210/pdb21TY/pdb">21TY</a> <a href="https://doi.org/10.2210/pdb9UVZ/pdb">9UVZ</a><br>EMDB: EMD-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/entry/emdb/EMD-64536">64536</a>, EMD-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/entry/emdb/EMD-64537">64537</a>, EMD-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/entry/emdb/EMD-64538">64538</a>, EMD-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/entry/emdb/EMD-64539">64539</a>, EMD-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/entry/emdb/EMD-64540">64540</a>, EMD-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/entry/emdb/EMD-64541">64541</a>, EMD-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/entry/emdb/EMD-67995">67995</a>, EMD-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/entry/emdb/EMD-64542">64542</a><br>EMPIAR: EMPIAR-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/emdb/empiar/entry/13413/">13413</a>, EMPIAR-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/emdb/empiar/entry/13412/">13412</a>, EMPIAR-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/emdb/empiar/entry/13414/">13414</a>, EMPIAR-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/emdb/empiar/entry/13416/">13416</a>, EMPIAR-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/emdb/empiar/entry/13415/">13415</a>, EMPIAR-<a href="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pdbe/emdb/empiar/entry/13417/">13417</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
            </div>
                      </article>
