                              </h3>
              
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Ohashi S*, Katayama K*#, <strong>Kojima A*, </strong>Yang X*, <strong>Fukuda M*, </strong>Sacchetta F, Suno R, Sugita Y, Nuemket N, <strong>Kim S, Kobayashi K,</strong> Imai H, Iwata S, Nango E, Kobayashi T, Noda T, Olivucci M#, <strong>Kato HE#, </strong>Kandori H#.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong><em>Science,</em></strong> in press (2026).</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">PDB: 9UPM, 9UPN, 9UPO<br>EMDB: EMD-64397, EMD-64398, EMD-64399<br>EMPIAR: EMPIAR-13418</p>
