                        <div class="pub-card__body">
              <h3 class="pub-card__title">
                                  <a href="https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-9039624/v1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The dark side of channelrhodopsins: intrinsic ion conductance of apo-opsins.</a>
                              </h3>
              
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Zhang C*, <strong>Ma J*, Fukuda M*,</strong> Lin Y*, Zhu M, Duan X, Zhou L, Zettner M, Yang S, Wang Y, Yu-Strzelczyk J, Zheng Q, Dannhäuser S, <strong>Kobayashi K, Tajima S, Nakamura S, Kim S, Takeno Y, </strong>Gee CE, Shi J, He Y, Kittel RJ, Heckmann M, Nagel G, Shen Y, Corry B#, <strong>Kato HE#,</strong> Gao S#.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Research Square,</strong> doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-9039624/v1">https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-9039624/v1</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">PDB: <br>EMDB: <br>EMPIAR: </p>
            </div>
                      </article>
                            <article class="pub-card pub-card--with-image">
                          <div class="pub-card__num">40</div>
